    "zh": "一次调用的路径：命令行入口解析出目标与动作 → 脚本引擎（可选的批量编排）→ 窗口识别与闸门 → 输入注入 → 原生互操作。下方三组是工程支撑。",
    "en": "One invocation flows left to right: the CLI resolves target and action, the script runner batches them, the window layer verifies the target, input injects, native does the syscalls. The lower group is engineering support."
